        {
            "_id": "iBqcyOkxBujCyrew",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Sack of Sand",
            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A grit flinger's bag is filled with infinite sand that they can use to beset their foes. The grit flinger can use their abilities with the earth trait only if they're holding an intact sack of sand in one hand. The sack can be targeted by Strikes (AC 27). If the sack of sand takes at least 15 piercing or slashing damage from a single Strike, it starts to leak. At the start of each of the grit flinger's turns, the leaking bag spills sand in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5], creating difficult terrain that lasts for 1 day. The grit flinger can repair the sack with 1 minute of work. If the sack is separated from the grit flinger, it loses its magic and becomes a mundane sack of sand.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "earth",
                        "primal"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "sSyFYU4Gt7omuUfS",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Wrathful Sands",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>10 feet. A cloud of sand surrounds the grit flinger. A creature that enters or begins its turn in the aura takes @Damage[4d6[slashing]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic] save. The grit flinger can activate or deactivate the aura with a Sustain action. If the grit flinger's sack of sand starts leaking, the aura ends.</p>"
                },
