        {
            "_id": "SYtqr5OfWgnJueja",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Disseminating Scurry",
            "sort": 800000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The grit flinger Strides up to half their Speed, spreading sand and gravel into the air while subtly guiding it into annoying nooks and crannies. Each creature the grit flinger moves adjacent to while scurrying must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:26] save as debris lodges uncomfortably under armor, in shoes, or up noses. On a failure, the creature becomes covered in sand until it spends an action shaking off the debris. Anytime a creature covered in sand attempts an action with the concentrate trait, the action is disrupted unless the creature succeeds at a @Check[flat|dc:5].</p>"
                },
